{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-5309273","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年东京Ingress活动","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"记录东京大型活动现场，与川岛先生及众多玩家相聚，感受Ingress社群对定位游戏的热爱与惊人热情。","date":"2016-09-14","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Ingressイベント","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Ingressイベント","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/5309273.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161006080602id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/5309273.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-5309273/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/001-9b78954137.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录东京大型活动现场，与川岛先生及众多玩家相聚，感受Ingress社群对定位游戏的热爱与惊人热情。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">7月在日本举办的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Ingress活动</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Aegis Nova Tokyo</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/001-9b78954137.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/001-9b78954137.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nNiantic的川岛先生！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/002-16f83d7240.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/002-16f83d7240.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n川岛先生亲自设计的\n精密逼真的超酷地图T恤，\n还请他签了名！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/003-c1f95f5db4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/003-c1f95f5db4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还有Ingress巴士哦！\n\n                好帅！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/004-2ed269334b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/004-2ed269334b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n近1万人聚集到台场的\n这场活动\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\nIngress的热爱，\n以及热爱定位游戏的大家的\n热情真是非同寻常！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/005-2fe7fe853d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/005-2fe7fe853d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nNiantic CEO约翰·汉克先生也\n登台亮相！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n增田是\nEnlightened 12级！\n距离13级还差237个CF……\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/006-284b0f6598.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/006-284b0f6598.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n同队获胜真让人开心！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田也\n玩了两年多的\nIngress，\n经常有人说它是\n宝可梦 GO的兄弟，\n但与其说是哥哥，不如说是\n父母的存在！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n为什么呢，\n因为如果没有Ingress，\n宝可梦 GO就不会\n诞生！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n策略性很高的酷炫定位游戏\n\nIngress\n\n推荐给大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">7月に日本で行われた</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Ingressのイベント</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Aegis Nova Tokyo</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/001-9b78954137.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/001-9b78954137.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nNiantic の川島さんと！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/002-16f83d7240.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/002-16f83d7240.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n川島さんがデザインした\n緻密リアルマップの超格好良いTシャツに\nサイン頂いた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/003-c1f95f5db4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/003-c1f95f5db4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nIngress バスもあったよ！\n\n                かっこいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/004-2ed269334b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/004-2ed269334b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\nお台場に1万人近くの人が集まった\nこのイベント\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nIngress 愛と\n位置情報ゲームを愛する皆さんの\n熱量が半端なかったです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/005-2fe7fe853d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/005-2fe7fe853d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nNiantic CEO ジョン・ハンケさんも\n登壇！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nマスダは\nEnlightened Level 12！\nレベル13まであとCF 237個・・・\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/006-284b0f6598.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5309273/006-284b0f6598.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n同じチームの勝利は嬉しい！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダも\n2年以上プレイしている\nIngress は\nPokémon GOの兄弟とよく言われるけど\nお兄さんというよりは\n親の存在！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなぜなら\nIngressが無かったら\nPokémon GOは\n生まれなかった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n戦略性の高いクールな位置情報ゲーム\n\nIngress\n\nオススメです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}